<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $200 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    30.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.065   PAY DATE  L-29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.665    SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE 2000</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
